#390731
`YHMS Majestic`w: `RCaptain's Cabin`w~
The captain's cabin aboard HMS Majestic sets a squared `wdesk`x beneath
orderly paneling. A thin decorative line follows the joinery, broken only
where a substantial fitting has been replaced with plainer wood. The chair
back is high and narrowly padded. Everything has been measured into the
confined hull, giving the small quarters a formal authority that reaches
beyond their modest span.`x
