the entrance to Gravesend High~
The far floor widens beside the `wwaiting bench`x, making a small pause within
the larger circulation space. The floor pattern shifts by half a tile near the
edge, a small irregularity in an otherwise formal arrangement. The broad
center makes movement legible, while the bench offers the more patient
perspective of waiting.`x
